# UX/UI for DOMIO PWAs

DOMIO Home (residents) and DOMIO Serwis (technicians and cleaning crews) are phone-first PWAs. Reuse the existing shadcn/ui component before adding one. Style with Tailwind utilities, mobile-first. UI copy is Polish.

## Touch and layout

- Interactive controls are at least 44×44 px (`min-h-11 min-w-11`). Separate adjacent targets by at least 8 px.
- One primary action stays in the thumb zone and is not covered by a sticky bar or the safe-area inset.
- Set `touch-action: manipulation` on buttons and links. A required action must not depend on hover.
- Stack content in one column. Add `sm:` only when that screen must also work on a tablet.
- An input has a visible label above the field, an `inputMode` that matches the data, and the error under the field.

## Contrast and components

- Body text and instructions meet WCAG AA (4.5:1), including outdoors. Do not use `text-gray-400` on a white or `slate-100` surface for text the user must read.
- Use the Radix behavior already inside shadcn. An icon-only button has an `aria-label`.
- Reuse Button, Card, Sheet, Dialog, and Form. Split a file that passes 300 lines.
- Every screen has a loading skeleton, an empty state, and an error state with retry.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`. Animate transform and opacity only.

```tsx
<Button className="min-h-11 w-full touch-manipulation" type="button">
  Zgłoś usterkę
</Button>
```
